@startuml
left to right direction

[*] --> MonitoringSpeed
MonitoringSpeed : SamplingGPS,\nComputingSpeed, \nValidatingActivity

MonitoringSpeed --> MonitoringSpeed : Speed < Threshold

MonitoringSpeed --> Recording : User presses Start\n(Manual)
MonitoringSpeed --> Recording : Speed > Threshold\n(Automated)

state Recording {
  [*] --> AcquiringData
  AcquiringData : Collect GPS,\nAccelerometer,\nGyroscope 
  
  AcquiringData --> Paused : Speed is 0\nfor T seconds
  Paused --> AcquiringData : Movement\nresumed
}

Recording --> AwaitingAction : Trip Ended
Recording --> AwaitingAction : User Stops

  AwaitingAction : Display statistics
  AwaitingAction : Request anomaly\nconfirmation 

AwaitingAction --> Discarded : User\nDiscards
AwaitingAction --> Saved : User\nSaves

Saved --> [*]
Discarded --> [*]
@enduml